{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "default_agent": "ship-mas",
  "instructions": [
    "MAS uses orchestrator (ship-mas) with math-proven v2 native scheduling (Little WIP≤2, Kahn layers, work-stealing pull pool with backpressure, CPM makespan, exit-0 gates, maker-checker), spawns agents in parallel via subagent tool, and verifies output before completing. 7 staged: discoverer, planner, implementer, tester, diagnostician, researcher + ship-mas orchestrator. Closed loop Core -> define -> planner -> implement -> test -> review. Agents are self-contained with direct tool access. General agent spawning is blocked in mode to prevent recursion.",
    "CRITICAL: Respect repository rules. Every repo defines agent rules via AGENTS.md and markdown files in its root. Read them as priority instructions. Never skip or override the instruction author."
  ],
